  "Name": "TugZip 3.5 Zip File Parsing Buffer Overflow Vulnerability",
  "Description": "This module exploits a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability in the latest version 3.5 of TugZip archiving utility. In order to trigger the vulnerability, an attacker must convince someone to load a specially crafted zip file with TugZip by double click or file open. By doing so, an attacker can execute arbitrary code as the victim user.",
